# MyPipCam agent bootstrap

Before installing, building, or configuring this repo, read and follow **[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)** at the repository root.

- No root `package.json` — work inside `apps/extension`, `apps/web`, or `apps/macos`.
- Extension load path is `apps/extension/dist` (unpacked), not `src`.
- Never commit `.env.local`, `*.pem`, or Supabase `service_role` keys. Use `.env.example` placeholders only.
